  <item>
    <title>Vol.66  姐妹夸夸群：谁听了不迷糊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63d8b42c6bcfd94102eb5ce0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63d8b42c6bcfd94102eb5ce0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Feb 2023 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年新气象！过完年的第一期，一起给对方打打气。</span></p><span></span><p><span>或许你目前也是，还沉浸在过年的情绪中，对新年后的生活难以投入。前后的开工，感觉更需要一些勇气和力气！这一期，是我们提前录制好的“姐妹互夸“：说一说对方身上的闪光点、说说过去的我们分别做了哪些大事、说说对方有多么的优秀！</span></p><span></span><p><span>夸完之后，祝愿彼此，能有热情高涨的新气象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023年来吧！又是一年新的开始！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Yao、YY、王大宝</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期可以听到】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 有希望做生活博主的YY：这生活情趣越来越有了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a> 与恶势力作斗争的Yao：正义且勇敢的当代打工人！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a>与工作和解的王大宝：这回真的想开了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a>反娇气先锋Yao：有远方，就要去！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="999">16:39</a>情绪管理有改善的王大宝：可以emo，但不要被困住！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a>能力者YY：能落地才是硬道理</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a>影响者YY：对大宝的帮助，是潜移默化</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">31:45</a> 全能时间管理大师Yao：文体两开花！阅读量翻翻！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">36:27</a>王大宝：状态好时，可以给他人开花</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2418">40:18</a> Yao：副业达人，有活就冲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a>王大宝：虽然没有挣到副业的钱，但为副业学习花了不少钱</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2863">47:43</a>财富敲门人YY：一直在折腾，一直在尝试！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> YY：友谊拔高，和老板做朋友！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3296">54:56</a> Yao：更喜欢人类了，更愿意分享！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3493">58:13</a>王大宝：勤劳的生活记录者</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> Yao：广播剧推广大使+情路避雷逃离渣男</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3878">64:38</a> 王大宝：八段锦推广大使+xing解放者</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> YY：目标信念感强大！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【联系我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>即刻微博都不咋更新，求个关注求催更——@嗑学小组</span></p><span></span><p><span>拉听友群就为了能有人和我们唠没用的+v：dabaomm101</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及开始许愿，会有合作吗？</span></p>]]></description>
