  <item>
    <title>Vol.64  今晚，我就是你们的狂野女孩 | 做梦篇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63bd146f289d2739647d9833</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63bd146f289d2739647d9833</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jan 2023 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期要聊的话题，有点梦幻、有点香艳、甚至有点让人恐惧，</span></p><span></span><p><span>就是我们曾经做过的各式各样的梦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>入睡后，大脑还没有停歇，它为我们编织了不同的场景：或是生活的延续和映射；或是脑洞的狂欢。总有些，光怪陆离的情节突然就上演。</span></p><span></span><p><span>提起难忘的梦，有些是童年阴影，有些是怅然若失，还有些是治愈和浪漫。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们从梦里，感受不少，那就录上一期记录一下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎你给我们讲讲，你做的很有意思的梦！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>YY、Yao、王大宝</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期可以听到】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a>道德压力！当猛男入梦，是拒绝、拒绝、还是拒绝？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a>真正的快乐：手动圣光、破镜重圆的超酷男孩、拥抱乡村美男子，春梦了无痕啊</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a>总能梦到被前男友PUA+考数学卷：这是造了什么孽啊！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a> 被追sha的少女：奔跑吧！压力！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> 这个小学时期的噩梦，让我记到现在……</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2059">34:19</a> 梦是现实映射的小电流</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">36:38</a> 梦是潜意识的体现，也是平衡情绪的工具</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">41:47</a> 现实向梦境：成年人俗气的快乐！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> 脑洞梦：再续新白娘子传奇、无限流闯关、影视化版权待签</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2935">48:55</a> 梦代表哪些意象？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3051">50:51</a> 我们仨：梦也这么不同！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【联系我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>即刻微博都不咋更新，求个关注求催更——@嗑学小组</span></p><span></span><p><span>拉听友群就为了能有人和我们唠没用的+v：dabaomm101</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及开始许愿，会有合作吗？</span></p>]]></description>
